  "name": "Enlarge/Reduce",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Pick Enlarge or Reduce when you cast. Willing creatures are affected without a save; use a (CON save) activity on an unwilling one. Enlarged: one size larger, Advantage on STR checks and saves, +1d4 weapon damage. Reduced: one size smaller, Disadvantage on STR checks and saves, -1d4 weapon damage.</p>",
